The structure of the rule engine in src/rules.mjs (validated frozen rule
objects, capped findings per rule, position-sorted findings, reverse-order fix
application) is adapted from bln-mcp-grammar-server
(https://github.com/theluckystrike/bln-mcp-grammar-server), released under
the MIT License, Copyright (c) Michal Lip. The Ukrainian-to-Polish and
Ukrainian-to-English rules and their Ukrainian explanations are new.

The language model is not part of this repository. Kladka is tested with
EuroLLM-9B-Instruct-2512 by the UTTER project (Apache License 2.0), in the
GGUF quantization published by mradermacher on Hugging Face.
